      "message": "\u003e \u003e Did you run into a particular problem on some platform?\n\u003e \n\u003e I think I ran into an issue on Windows with mingw-w64 and pthreads at some point, but it could be that this patch was mainly due to trying to get linking to be consistent since I\u0027ve had a lot of issues with libwebp in the past few years on and off\n\nThanks. On windows I have a nightly visual studio run for cmake, but defer to autoconf under cygwin and msys2.",
