      "writtenOn": "2022-06-01T00:12:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would autoconf be considered the \"official\" buildsystem to use with cygwin/msys2?\n\n\nIt seems I switched to CMake away from autoconf for libwebp at one point due to the issues mentioned in https://github.com/m-ab-s/media-autobuild_suite/issues/1983 with  linking errors with libtiff, but I can try again with autoconf if I should move back or not",
      "parentUuid": "66bb5afa_fd97f3d1",
      "revId": "0d1b9bc4330701df42c6fa9e0b4f72fe74b25684",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
